---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Thank you
description: "Your message is on its way."
permalink: /thank-you/
hide_footer_cta: true
---
<section class="thank-you">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Got it</span>
    <h1 class="page-title">Thanks — your message is in.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Here's what happens next.</p>
    <div class="thank-you__steps">
      <div class="thank-you__step">
        <div class="thank-you__step-num">1</div>
        <div>
          <div class="thank-you__step-title">A confirmation email</div>
          <p class="thank-you__step-body">You should see one in your inbox within a few minutes. If it doesn't turn up, have a look in the spam folder.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="thank-you__step">
        <div class="thank-you__step-num">2</div>
        <div>
          <div class="thank-you__step-title">A reply from me, usually within a day</div>
          <p class="thank-you__step-body">I'll write back with the next step — a call confirmation, a rough estimate, or a follow-up question.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="thank-you__step">
        <div class="thank-you__step-num">3</div>
        <div>
          <div class="thank-you__step-title">In the meantime</div>
          <p class="thank-you__step-body">Have a look through <a href="{{ meta.liveExample }}">a live example</a>, read a few pages of the <a href="/docs/">guides</a>, or poke around <a href="/features/">what's included</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: var(--space-xl);">
      <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/">Back to home</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
